      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How about this idea instead? https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/add-a-stealth-mode-to-allow-people-to-appear-offline\n\nYours is a great idea, but unfortunately it could result in users being able to soft ban/kick others from instances by setting themselves to Do Not Disturb, and thus locking their friends out of otherwise public instances. A more elegant solution would be a simple Offline status, which will make you totally invisible and ensure you have the space you need. (You can still send invites of course!)",
