      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name}: People would still see the world you're in and attempt to join every active instance until they find you, and with less popular worlds that won't be hard. Unless you hide the world you're in completely from the public, and at that point, why not just go with an offline status? :P\n\nWell, either one we go with will be an improvement in the end I guess! Anything to have some breathing room in public worlds again.",
