      "value": "I want this and think it would be positive for the community and an extremely useful featuew. \n\n\nThroughout the year ive had people that talked over conversations and joined on me nonstop.  Decent people that just didnt know when to stop.  It sucks that the only solution is unfriending and blocking.. which often caused a ton of unneeded drama after.\n\nSomething simple like this would be a major improvement for me.",
